WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:02.317
Another federal deadline.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.147
Another SF330 scramble.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.417
Meet Rivet!

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:09.887
It watches SAM.gov for work that fits your firm.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.897
Reads every solicitation.

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:14.937
Scores your fit… and shows you why.

00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:17.257
Your strongest projects? Found!

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.167
The right people? Matched!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.647
Your experience matrix? Built!

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.697
It drafts the resumes, project sheets, and narratives.

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:27.017
Correct it once… It remembers.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.748
Your whole SF330.

00:00:28.781 --> 00:00:29.367
Assembled.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.777
Ready for review!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.317
AI does the groundwork.

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:34.487
Your team makes the calls.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:35.357
Rivet!

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:38.360
From SAM.gov… to a winning proposal!
